# Scratch working dir for raw extracts + intermediate GeoJSON/NDJSON.
# The Geofabrik .pbf is large and rebuilt daily — never commit it (see README).
.scratch/

# Intermediate artifacts if run outside .scratch/
*.osm.pbf
*.osm.pbf.md5

# The Census TIGER state-boundary archive (N7). Same rule as the other packages' `.raw/`: not
# disposable scratch but the thing that makes the five-state region mask reproducible. Unlike an OSM
# extract it is a pinned annual vintage, so re-fetching next year yields DIFFERENT boundaries unless
# `TIGER_STATES` is bumped deliberately. 10 MB of third-party data — mirror it, don't commit it.
.raw/
